WEBVTT

00:01:47.702 --> 00:01:50.485
Soul Contract

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.252
18th Contract

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.392
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.850
Expect me to go berserk

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.680
What's that noise?

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.720
Sounds like it came from the shed

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.040
Go check it out

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:15.000
Yes

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:21.160
Oh dear, this demonic being is too strong

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.430
I really can't suppress it any longer

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.080
Great grandma

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.480
Please let me try

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:29.390
No

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.650
Old Lady

00:02:30.652 --> 00:02:32.433
This is an emergency

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.520
Don't assume that I'm ignorant of your scheme

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.100
Once she purifies it

00:02:38.107 --> 00:02:42.197
You'd say the Yangming Master has forfeited his duty

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.040
That's right

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.440
I'd like to ask you

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:49.480
In the past, when a Yangming Master forfeited his duty,

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.800
how was he dealt with?

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.160
If it's a serious case,

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.400
his position would surely get revoked, right?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.410
Revoke...

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.080
Yangming Master?

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.940
Why do you come back?

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:05.180
Your boundary limit is already...

00:03:05.182 --> 00:03:07.613
I'm really M (Masochist), okay?

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:09.230
Why is the sword so fast?

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.460
As if it's part of him

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.560
Usually, I'm not interested in you

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.620
but since you want to die so much

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.980
Stop playing around

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.180
Think I'd fall for that?

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.500
This is Situ family's sacred wooden plate

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.080
Spirit Enforcement Talisman

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.920
No spirit can escape from its control

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.800
If I can't control you,

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:49.643
I'll enforce this on you

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.010
This is...

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:21.160
Every spirit has a weakness

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:24.400
It can search your weakest area in your heart

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.980
and slowly make you sink into despair

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:28.100
You just wait

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.310
and be my puppet

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.420
Yang Jinghua

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.560
Run quickly

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.940
You bastard

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.380
You're almost dying

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.520
and you still wanna get in my way?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.489
Cocky

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:40.800
I'll let you get cocky

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.400
-The things you owe me
-Duanmu Xi

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.120
I want you to refund with interest charged

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.000
L-Let go of him

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.420
Wanna save him?

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.160
As if you can

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.440
Lemme tell you

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.040
Unless I die,

00:04:53.193 --> 00:04:58.035
I'll never let him go as long as I live

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.520
Why do you hate him so much?

00:05:01.668 --> 00:05:06.140
He killed both people who're most important in my life

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:06.150
Surely you didn't forget about the deviating things that Duanmu Xi did
He killed both people who're most important in my life

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:10.360
Surely you didn't forget about the deviating things that Duanmu Xi did

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.720
Boisterous and disobedient

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.220
Took in a Soul Image by force

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:16.040
Publicly displayed sword gifting

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.560
Now he lost his power

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.200
and disappears to nowhere

00:05:19.203 --> 00:05:21.399
while the world is facing its doom

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:23.020
So unvirtuous and unrighteous

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.700
An outlaw at best

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:28.220
Should you not revoke this Yangming Master?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.140
Shut up

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.780
You think you can simply slander a Yangming Master?

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:33.800
Oh right

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:37.020
He was a street rat taken in by Old Lady

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.360
He shouldn't be a Yangming Master from start

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.400
What I say

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.220
is the fact that everyone knew, isn't it?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:47.160
The time when the crazy b*tch from Shenlong family

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.960
caused such a huge ruckus

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.510
Just shut the hell up

00:05:50.512 --> 00:05:53.060
Don't you ever speak of that woman

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:53.071
Great grandma
Don't you ever speak of that woman

00:05:53.071 --> 00:05:53.960
Great grandma

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.430
Calm down

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:56.490
Yeah

00:05:56.494 --> 00:05:58.947
Let me settle this

00:05:58.947 --> 00:06:02.480
K-Kick her... out

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:02.490
Kick out
K-Kick her... out

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:03.900
Kick out

00:06:04.431 --> 00:06:05.276
Oh?

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.230
Then if I won't go,

00:06:07.231 --> 00:06:09.483
what else can you do to me?

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:10.440
Stop,

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.087
or else you'll be sorry

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.540
Duanmu isn't around

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:26.220
I'm looking after this house for him

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:30.680
Y-You lie

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.900
Duanmu Xi won't kill anyone

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.020
Lil' Soul Image

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.120
You really don't know anything about him

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.400
This bastard shouldn't have lived

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:42.360
The number of people he killed is more than the fingers on your hand

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.720
He is a murderer

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.620
Jinghua

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:46.570
Watch out

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.015
Gotcha

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.000
The hair tie

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.480
This tassel was weaved with my fetal hair

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.440
It contains my life force

00:07:05.441 --> 00:07:07.014
Even if I'm gone,

00:07:07.014 --> 00:07:10.952
you'll never disappear as long as you wear it

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:14.960
Let go

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.030
You're dying and you still wanna fight

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.920
You should let go

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:23.560
What will happen to your Soul Image if this breaks?

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.380
I can't wait to find out

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.730
Duanmu

00:07:27.733 --> 00:07:28.853
Duanmu Xi

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.800
Your Soul Image is such a faithful dog

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.520
He never reveals your birth date at all

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.920
but there's more than a way to put a curse on you

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.240
Yang Jinghua

00:07:40.242 --> 00:07:41.873
Please go

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.730
Duanmu

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.270
Don't look

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.840
Duanmu Xi

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.700
I told you not to look

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:15.160
You wanna die, eh?

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.380
Not so easy

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:20.840
I'd rather make it a living hell for you

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.420
Duanmu Xi

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.550
You again

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:34.360
What did you say about Duanmu?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.860
I almost forgot

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:38.180
This gal is also a medium

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.240
with a fiery yang physique

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.860
She can cast spells too

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.890
Street rat?

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.600
Then what about you?

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.380
The place you live,

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.900
the basking sunlight,

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.290
the air you breathe

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:53.280
It's all given by this street rat in exchange for his life

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.580
Your Situ family

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.900
owes the Duanmus these debts for ages

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.070
Without them,

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.440
you wouldn't get to live this long

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:04.820
But that doesn't change the fact about Duanmu forfeiting his duty

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:04.830
Forfeiting duty?
But that doesn't change the fact about Duanmu forfeiting his duty

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.300
Forfeiting duty?

00:09:06.305 --> 00:09:09.286
Do you know what he has done?

00:09:09.286 --> 00:09:11.520
He always sacrifices alone

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:14.580
He's way ahead of you before you even realize

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.380
You say without proof

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.840
No one can claim to know about the past

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.900
Now that the demonic spirit is here

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:27.010
He will certainly lose his job if he doesn't come back by dawn

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.220
He will come back

00:09:29.223 --> 00:09:30.534
because

00:09:30.534 --> 00:09:33.803
he's got the best Soul Image with him

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.940
Look at your pathetic face

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:39.990
Serves you right

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.830
Duanmu Xi

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.600
Lil' Soul Image

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.240
You still won't leave?

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:49.150
Do you wanna stay and watch the excitement?

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:49.910
You...

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.940
I can't win against you

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.790
but there are some things I can still do

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.160
Yang Jinghua

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.700
Promise me not to break this tassel

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.580
I swear to keep the promises over a hundred years

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.350
That's all, isn't it?

00:10:09.353 --> 00:10:10.165
Jinghua

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:11.720
No

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.280
Duanmu Xi

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.860
I finally owe you nothing

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:18.870
Take back your power

00:10:18.873 --> 00:10:21.687
and be a good Yangming Master

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.600
Yang Jinghua!

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:37.360
-The power is flooding out
-Evil spirits are agitated

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.200
Eat him

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.560
I want power

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.820
N-No

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:44.830
Why the demonic spirits suddenly burst out
N-No

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.680
Why the demonic spirits suddenly burst out

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.150
What?

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.054
The time isn't up yet

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:53.530
You guys protect great grandma

00:10:53.534 --> 00:10:55.601
I'll seal the demon

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.600
Great grandma

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:07.940
Am I doing good?

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.340
Can I be a Yangming Master?

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.420
What's so great being a Yangming Master?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:15.320
I only hope that you to be an ordinary girl

00:11:15.324 --> 00:11:18.151
And live a normal life

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.430
Foolish child

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:24.760
Duanmu family is known for having lots of talented specialists

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.900
but you have only one who can manage

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.480
What are you gawking at?

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.700
Hurry up and help 2nd Lady

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.810
Yes

00:11:41.409 --> 00:11:42.964
I want...

00:11:42.964 --> 00:11:43.842
Lord...

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:44.940
I want it...

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:45.860
Give me power

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:50.580
Lowly beings like you dare to ambush my power?

00:11:50.891 --> 00:11:51.856
Be gone

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.380
What is this power?

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.500
A youkai?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:00.860
No

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.120
Is it a demon?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.690
D-Don't come closer

00:12:03.696 --> 00:12:05.256
Who are you?

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.960
A scoundrel does not deserve to know my name

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.630
Yang Jinghua

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.420
Do you still remember what you promised me?

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.600
Don't you ever forget your name

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.880
Don't forget who you are

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.350
Little priest,

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.020
it must have been tough on you

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.180
Too bad,

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.900
it's already too late

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:49.160
You have lost this bet
